        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-480 (ensure controlled execution — Mental Health, Wellness &amp; Employee Assistance Program (PA-83.3).) | - operational: RA 11036-aligned design and DOH standards
Owner: EAP Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
